                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a terrible terrible mobile game. You have to seriously grind to get upgrades and there are no hotkeys. \n\nGameplay consists of scrolling to find enemies, dragging abilities to enemies and holding the left mouse button to damage them. \n\nThere's only the slightest hint of a tower defense element in the form of the 2-3 mostly useless creatures you can place. There is no single enemy path, they come from half a dozen separate ones. There's no strategy involved. Even with three in place at best they slow the enemy, 95% of the damage still comes from the player.\n\nThe \"three campaigns\" are just three different gods that have their own basic ability, upgraded ability and ranged attacker. You constantly play on the same map for each god, with the same spawn points. The maps are virtually the same since there are proper paths, the higher ones just require more annoying scrolling to find the enemy on the other side of the hill.\n\nOh, and balance is awful. One map i nearly died, the next i survived with almost no damage, the one after that with half my temple intact. All with the same set of upgrades. It's just awful all around.",
